WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.760
Looking to increase your chance of success when advertising?

00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:04.600
You've come to the right place.

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:08.962
In this video, we'll explain what it takes to get your product detail pages

00:00:08.962 --> 00:00:14.260
retail-ready and how you can select the best products to advertise to meet your business goals.

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:19.120
To start, choose products that are in stock and reasonably priced so customers are motivated to

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:20.280
click on your ad.

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:24.123
We recommend using our automated pricing tool to quickly adjust your prices in

00:00:24.123 --> 00:00:27.080
real time as it can help you to remain competitive.

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:29.738
When your products are in stock and priced

00:00:29.738 --> 00:00:34.438
competitively, they are eligible to be selected as the featured offer, which is the section of the

00:00:34.438 --> 00:00:37.980
product detail page where customers can add items to their cart or buy now.

00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:39.108
When multiple sellers

00:00:39.108 --> 00:00:44.193
offer the same product, Amazon combines the offers into one product detail page so we can

00:00:44.193 --> 00:00:45.900
present customers with the best experience.

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:48.626
We recommend choosing products that regularly display

00:00:48.626 --> 00:00:55.000
the featured offer to help maximize your visibility and sales and to help ensure your ad displays.

00:00:55.080 --> 00:01:01.184
Finally, ensure each product you advertise has at least 15 customer reviews and a three-and-a-half

00:01:01.184 --> 00:01:02.540
star rating or higher.

00:01:02.760 --> 00:01:06.360
This is especially important because customers like to hear from other customers.

00:01:06.640 --> 00:01:11.240
When your product has positive reviews, shoppers may be more likely to consider purchasing it.

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:16.543
Once you have your inventory, pricing, and reviews ready, it's time to focus on the product detail

00:01:16.543 --> 00:01:16.840
page.

00:01:16.960 --> 00:01:20.380
The product detail page is what customers see when they click on your ad.

00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:21.695
Let's take a closer

00:01:21.695 --> 00:01:26.625
look at what makes your product detail page ready to help drive easier purchase decisions

00:01:26.625 --> 00:01:27.940
and advertising campaign results.

00:01:28.180 --> 00:01:31.234
To start, each product detail page should have a strong title

00:01:31.234 --> 00:01:32.900
that's no more than 60 characters.

00:01:33.300 --> 00:01:35.400
Your title is your first impression with customers.

00:01:35.640 --> 00:01:36.440
It should

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:41.240
be descriptive and informative, including your brand name, materials, color, and size.

00:01:41.440 --> 00:01:41.950
This can

00:01:41.950 --> 00:01:44.500
lead to more page clicks and consideration of your product.

00:01:44.860 --> 00:01:47.173
Next, use three or more bullet points to

00:01:47.173 --> 00:01:48.040
introduce your product.

00:01:48.240 --> 00:01:52.440
Share dimensions, uses, and other descriptive features as a product overview.

00:01:52.700 --> 00:01:56.969
You can provide greater detail in your product description where you're able to tell customers

00:01:56.969 --> 00:02:00.100
about product benefits and help them discover answers to their questions.

00:02:00.380 --> 00:02:01.740
Be sure to include

00:02:01.740 --> 00:02:05.480
relevant shopping terms that your audience might use when exploring products.

00:02:05.960 --> 00:02:07.043
This can help improve

00:02:07.043 --> 00:02:10.020
the chances that people find your listing and consider your product.

00:02:10.220 --> 00:02:11.667
Once you feel good about

00:02:11.667 --> 00:02:14.560
your title and description, it's time to focus on visuals.

00:02:14.880 --> 00:02:17.400
Images and videos are powerful storytellers.

00:02:17.760 --> 00:02:19.600
They can show the versatility of your product.

00:02:19.880 --> 00:02:21.640
They can demonstrate your product in use,

00:02:21.960 --> 00:02:24.720
and they can be an effective way to connect with customers.

00:02:25.160 --> 00:02:26.866
So it's essential that you choose

00:02:26.866 --> 00:02:29.140
the right visuals for your product detail page.

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:32.179
To start, you'll want to include four or more

00:02:32.179 --> 00:02:36.440
high-quality images that show your product from different angles and highlight important details.

00:02:36.900 --> 00:02:41.518
Make sure your images are at least a thousand pixels in height or width to enable the zoom function

00:02:41.518 --> 00:02:43.220
so customers can get a closer look.

00:02:43.580 --> 00:02:46.302
Finally, if you're an Amazon vendor or a brand registered

00:02:46.302 --> 00:02:49.840
seller, you have the option to add A+ content to your page.

00:02:49.960 --> 00:02:52.458
A+ content is a unique way to

00:02:52.458 --> 00:02:54.020
create a delightful shopping experience.

00:02:54.220 --> 00:02:57.487
You can add enhanced images, charts, videos, and rich text

00:02:57.487 --> 00:03:00.100
to help make your products even more compelling.

00:03:00.340 --> 00:03:02.687
These can help you increase engagement with your

00:03:02.687 --> 00:03:04.740
product detail page and drive more conversions.

00:03:05.400 --> 00:03:07.838
With these tips in mind, your products are ready

00:03:07.838 --> 00:03:08.380
for advertising.

00:03:08.660 --> 00:03:12.654
Now it's time to pick the best products that can help you achieve your campaign

00:03:12.654 --> 00:03:12.920
objectives.

00:03:13.240 --> 00:03:17.598
If you're looking to increase purchases, try promoting products that have strong customer

00:03:17.598 --> 00:03:20.280
reviews by using phrase or exact keyword matches.

00:03:20.560 --> 00:03:23.120
This will help increase traffic to your most

00:03:23.120 --> 00:03:24.400
popular product detail pages.

00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:27.975
If you're launching a new product and you want to drive traffic,

00:03:27.975 --> 00:03:32.475
consider including it in a campaign with broad keyword match types to help shoppers discover your

00:03:32.475 --> 00:03:33.600
brand and new products.

00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:38.058
Remember, your advertising strategy is most effective when you are bringing

00:03:38.058 --> 00:03:41.300
shoppers to informative, retail-ready product detail pages.

00:03:41.600 --> 00:03:42.600
Ready to get started?

00:03:42.920 --> 00:03:44.150
Visit ads.

00:03:44.150 --> 00:03:44.765
amazon.

00:03:44.765 --> 00:03:45.380
com.
